'''Crazed Titan Cat''' (狂乱の巨神ネコ, ''Kyōran no Kyoshin Neko'', '''Frenzy Titan Cat''', '''''Frenzy Giant Cat''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that first appears in [[Crazy Cats (Insane)|Crazy Cats]], where he can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

